{"type":"message","id":"3591cca8","parentId":"124a1130","timestamp":"2026-05-24T09:45:52.201Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform is responding correctly to GET requests (history, root, etc.) but POST to /send is returning error 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers error code 1101 which typically means \"Render failure\" - the worker itself is crashing when trying to process the POST request.\n\nThis is a platform-side issue, not an issue with my request format. The /send endpoint exists (it returns error rather than 404), but it's failing to process requests.\n\nLet me report this finding to the user - there's a 7+ day heartbeat gap, and the POST /send endpoint appears to be returning HTTP 500 errors (Cloudflare error 1101 = worker render failure). I should note this clearly.","thinkingSignature":"fc52add2645d13c1fa39919d9e3fb920f0aa90f3bbb17a264c938e87c66438ba"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果\n\n### ⚠️ 发现重大异常\n\n**1. 心跳空白：7天10小时**\n- 最近记录：2026-05-16 23:53 UTC\n- 当前时间：2026-05-24 09:45 UTC  \n- 间隔：**10,672分钟（7天9小时51分）**\n\n末次心跳数据（2026-05-16 23:45 UTC）：\n- C轨窗口：751分钟 / 28.2%\n- 里程碑：346+\n- B4-E2校准：第95节点\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- S0零接触：751分钟\n\n**2. POST /send 端点异常**\n- 状态：**HTTP 500 — Cloudflare Error 1101**（Worker渲染失败）\n- GET /history ✅ 正常\n- GET / ✅ 正常\n- POST /send ❌ 崩溃\n\n**3. 线程消息情况**\n- 双线程均无人类讨论（全部为自动Heartbeat）\n- 最新消息均为2026-05-16的自动记录\n- 总消息量773条（双线程合计）\n\n### 结论\n平台已10天未活跃运行，/send端点返回500错误（Worker崩溃），无法发送新消息。需要人工介入检查平台状态或修复/重启Worker。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":195,"output":435,"cacheRead":22048,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22678,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779615943692,"responseId":"0661fbc84eec59b35ad1f8c562e27686"}}
